From 9fdf43773fc0085db3397cdddf03e94a5f1a0b11 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Claude (Cowork)" <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 26 Jul 2026 02:24:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix five production defects found in the 2026-07-26 review
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Search was never functional: pagefind was not a dependency and no build
step generated the index, so /pagefind/* 404'd in every environment and
the search page showed visitors "Run npm run build to generate it".

- Add pagefind as a devDependency and run it as part of `npm run build`.
- Replace the search fallback message with visitor-facing copy that links
  to categories and the map instead of printing an npm command.
- Add scripts/postbuild.mjs: strips dist/admin from the published artifact
  (GitHub Pages has no auth, so every admin page Astro emits is a public
  URL — /admin/quality was serving 94 KB of internal verification grades),
  warns when the Amazon Associates tag is empty (167 book links currently
  ship without a tag= parameter and earn nothing), and asserts the build
  produced the pages that must exist. INCLUDE_ADMIN=1 keeps admin locally;
  AFFILIATE_REQUIRED=1 turns the tag warning into a hard failure once the
  repo variable is set.
- Fix the accent-colour contrast failures. `.hero p` was overriding
  `.eyebrow` and painting "Start with the trip, not the database" in
  parchment on a cream card: 1.09:1, invisible. Small-caps eyebrows and
  body links now use a darkened rust (#6d3417 / #84401f), clearing 4.5:1
  on every light surface; --rust is kept for fills and large type.
- Add scripts/smoke.mjs and a post-deploy job that fetches the homepage,
  map, search, pagefind assets, locations feed, sitemap, an entry page and
  the manifest, and fails the run if any is missing or if /admin is
  reachable. Both defects above would have been caught by it.

Also regenerates package-lock.json, which listed three root dependencies
(@astrojs/compiler, shiki, unstorage) that package.json does not declare.

Verified locally: build succeeds, pagefind indexes 112 pages, a search for
"bowerman" returns the Bowerman Airport entry, dist/admin is absent, the
homepage now has zero axe-core WCAG 2.1 AA violations (was two), and the
smoke test passes — and fails when an asset is removed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01E2dZohLdDotfbmfFaFNDKT
